		{"excall", call=0, file="hat020070"},
		line=1212,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"The early morning air in the dojo is thick with tension.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Wooden blade in hand, Hotori faces me down.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Her perfect stance, devoid of even the slightest opening, is breathtakingly beautiful.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Drawn in by the sight of her, my guard slips by the tiniest of fractions.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Haaaaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Hotori doesn't let the chance slip by.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"She closes the distance in a single stride.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"I parry her thrust, and our blades lock together at the hilt in a contest of strength.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Hotori pushes back with power you'd never expect from her slim frame.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Her unyielding strength is as a supple willow.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Unable to overpower her, I ease up ever so slightly, causing her to lose her balance and opening up a momentary window.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Taking a half step back, I swing at her from the side.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"My attack should have connected with her wrist, but she is no amateur.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"She deftly knocks it aside and follows through with an instant counterattack.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hah!”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"The air splits wide faster than my eyes can follow.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Her lightning slash rends the air I occupied mere moments ago.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"I parry her second attack and strike back before she can launch her third.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kh!”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"The tip of my blade grazes the edge of her hair.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Several severed strands drift on the wind, reflecting the morning sun like threads of gold.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Seemingly unperturbed, Hotori quickly takes her distance and resets her stance.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Haah...”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Only then does she breathe out a thin sigh.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"At that signal, I drop my own guard.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's call it here.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Hotori does the same with a nod.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Thanks to Kotone's Healing, her wounds don't seem to be impairing her movements.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Looks like you're doing just fine now.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I couldn't get a read on your moves at all.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh, enough with the jokes.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"She admonishes me with a chagrined shrug.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And how are your injur...”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah, like I even have to ask.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"I smile ambivalently at her question.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"The wounds I received in my battle with Hotori have all vanished without a trace.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"The gash on my shoulder, the crippling frostbite, even my severed hand are all back to normal.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"It's beyond all explanation.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Even Kotone was just as perplexed when she examined my wounds.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Have I turned into some living revenant?",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Truthfully, it's rather unsettling.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"But it matters not to me.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"I am and will always be a warrior.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"The stronger I am the better, all for the sake of better serving my lord.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Do you remember our fight yesterday?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Hotori mutters, staring up at a faraway point on the ceiling.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I couldn't possibly forget it.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, you were way stronger than me. No doubt about it.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That doesn't mean anything. You were being controlled.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No need to try and console me.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But after today, I get it now.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You're getting stronger and stronger every day.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't take this the wrong way, but like... it kinda freaks me out.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“O-Oh.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"That's a rather disheartening way to put it.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah, I'm sorry! Did I upset you?”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I didn't mean it in a bad way. You're freaky in a good way. The best way.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Like, you're freakishly strong?”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ahh, ugh, sorry...”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, it's all good.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"I direct an honest smile at Hotori's flustered expression. ",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"I don't understand what in the world is happening to my body myself.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's because of Miyaguni, isn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"I could never hide a matter of the blade from a fellow warrior.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari's voice somehow stirs up strength I didn't know I had within me.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't understand it one bit.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But when I fight on behalf of Akari, I feel like I'm my true self.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's like I go back to being my old self, from before the war.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Ever since I met Akari, it occasionally feels like the gears inside me are locking into their rightful place.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"Whenever that happens, my senses are sharpened beyond their limits, and my body moves of its own accord.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I suppose I'm just not good enough, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's not a matter of being good enough or not. Miyaguni is just special.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hearing that only makes me more jealous.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Hotori dejectedly slumps her shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“How is your memory doing? If you've gone back to how you were before the war, can you remember anything?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not at the moment, no.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh, I see.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry. Thanks for always being so concerned for me.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hey, no need to act like such a stranger.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Just how long do you think we've been together at this point?”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I feel like all I do is take without ever giving anything back.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"After the war, she had to teach me all the ways of the world from scratch, up to and including what my own name was.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"And even now, she takes care of all my daily necessities. It must have felt to her like taking care of a child with an adult body.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I-In that case, can I ask you to do me a little favor today?”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Hotori uncharacteristically makes a request of me for once.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, whatever you need.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Can you take a look at my crest for me?”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It feels kinda tingly.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let me see.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Hotori takes off her clothes, exposing the pale skin of her back.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"I momentarily lose myself in that spotless field of pure white.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Her faint peach fuzz catches the light and shimmers like powder snow.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"However, a single blemish sticks out amidst that otherwise flawless expanse of smooth skin.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"A reddish-black emblem covering her right shoulder blade.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Her spellcrest, the proof of her warrior's lineage.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Our superhuman strength is caused by a genetically inherited “warrior factor.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"If the factor manifests before the age of ten, you will develop heightened physical abilities, but if it doesn't,\nyou'll live out your life as an ordinary civilian.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"And without exception, anyone who expresses this factor will find a spellcrest engraved upon their bodies.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Generally, only those who bear this emblem are referred to as “warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Incidentally, there is a clear gender difference in the rate at which the factor manifests.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"While it almost always manifests in men, it happens exceedingly rarely amongst women.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Female warriors like Hotori, Koyuzu, and Mutsumi-san are few and far between indeed.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's a little red.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Looks like it'll probably heal up in a couple of days, though.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Our crests tend to flare up when a large amount of spellforce passes through our bodies or when we're in poor physical condition.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Hotori's battle with me the other day is the likely cause.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's a relief.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What about where I was cut? Here on my side.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Hotori twists around slightly, and the pristine field of snow expands before my eyes. ",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Once I look closely, I spot the faint outline of a scar on her flank.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"It's the same wound I myself gave her.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Amazing...”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh? Wh-What is?”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone's magicks, of course. You can hardly even see the wound anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“O-Oh, right... her magicks...”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's a relief, though. I wouldn't want it to interfere with my work.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, you mean Natsumi?”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's a good point. I'd definitely be startled to see a wound like that on a singer. Haha.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hey, it's no laughing matter. It'd be bad if it gets out that\nI'm a warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You could just not wear such revealing outfits.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm not the one that gets to pick my costumes.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'd prefer if I didn't have to show off so much skin too, you know.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's not like there's anything worth seeing anyways...”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"She trails off in a faint mumble.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your skin is gorgeous. Have some more confidence in yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“C-Come on... Me, gorgeous...?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"She stammers as her pale white skin takes on a lovely pink flush.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Cut that out. It's giving me weird ideas if you act all bashful like that...”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Wh-What sorta weird ideas?”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't ask me that...”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"An awkward silence fills the dojo.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Right now, just a single, narrow layer of cloth is all that covers her chest.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"And even through its thin fabric, the soft curves of her ample breasts stand out in sharp relief.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"As she fidgets in place, that band of cloth slips ever so slightly lower.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Do you, um... feel anything from me?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Feel what?”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't ask me that!”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Y-You know, like... the charm of a woman, or...”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course I do.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hyaaaa?!”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Hotori lets out a shrill shriek, her hands trembling.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I-I-I, um, also...”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But those are all worldly thoughts.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thoughts that will only dull my blade when the time comes.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I-I know that. 'Heart and blade in concord,' right?”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"If my heart goes awry, so shall my blade.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Extirpate all obstructive thoughts and achieve inner harmony. Only then can one attain true mastery. ",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sorry, I shouldn't have asked that. That was awfully un-warriorlike of me, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Get your act together, chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Acting",
{"/font"},
" chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm just temporarily watching over the Blades until Father comes back.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't be getting the wrong idea now.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“He's your master, too, isn't he? It's like you've already forgotten about him.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"Well, I suppose she has a good point.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"We still don't know what Kokuan-dono's status is, so it's wrong to treat him like he's already dead.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, get your act together as though you're the chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your inspector general will do everything he can to support you.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You're gonna watch my back?”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hehee. Thanks, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Hotori turns and smiles at me with a face that looks on the verge of tears.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"At the same time, a certain narrow strip of cloth flutters down.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Preoccupied with our exchange, Hotori's hand had slackened its grip.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"With absolutely nothing in its way, her beautiful chest basks unobstructed in the dawn's early rays.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Two shapely bulges that make me want to reach out in spite of myself.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Aaahh?!”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Before Hotori's scream even reaches my ears, an even louder noise crashes out from the dojo entrance.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"I manage to avert my gaze from Hotori only to find Akari having tumbled inside in spectacular fashion.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Miyaguni?!”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"Hotori clasps her clothes to her chest in a panic.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What do you think you're doing?”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I-It's not like I was trying to peep or anything! I just didn't have a good timing to come in, you know...”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I didn't want to interrupt you two, you know...”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hold up! You're definitely getting the wrong idea here.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I was just having Soujin look at my spellcrest, that's all.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“D-Don't worry, I don't have the wrong idea. Definitely not.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Anyway, I'll be going now!”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hey, Akari?!”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Akari runs off before I have the chance to stop her.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Th-There she goes.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Y-Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"The two of us stare vacantly at the entrance.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sorry if she gets the wrong idea about us.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It was an accident. You have nothing to apologize for.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But you said Miyaguni was special to you...”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Seems like you're the one with the wrong idea here.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“To ever lay a hand on my lord would go against the way of the warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Even if I did have romantic feelings for her, the only right thing to do would be to bury those feelings deep in my heart.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Now that you mention it, yeah... She's your ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"lord,",
{"/font"},
" isn't she?”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's right... ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"She's your lord...",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Come on, we're gonna be late if we don't get going as well.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah, let's go.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"Hotori leaps up with a curious bounce to her step.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"We happen to run into Akari assiduously praying at the nearby altar, and the three of us start on the way home together.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"After a considerable amount of reassurance, we somehow manage to get her to understand the nature of our relationship.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Come to think of it, Soujin's seen me naked, too.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin. Explain yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"She must be talking about the night we first met.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"It was when I treated her wounds after she was shot by\nOkonogi's guards.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That was our unforgettable first night together.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hweh?!”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Hotori's looks as though her soul has escaped from her body.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I needed to make the most out of every second I had...”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You had it that bad...?”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Okay, look, Soujin. You're definitely giving her the wrong idea.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How so?”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"Akari lets out a deep sigh.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou, all he did was give me some first aid, okay?”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He said 'first night together' because that was the night we first met in Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“O-Oh! Th-That's what you meant...”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"This time, it's Hotori who moves to wipe the sweat from her brow.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What did you think I meant?”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Didn't I just tell you I would never lay a hand on my lord?”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"It would be terrible if Akari also got the wrong idea.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, I have nothing to be ashamed of.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah, I get it...”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"As the clock approaches eight in the morning, more and more people begin to fill the streets.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's rougher than I expected, being glared at like that.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, it's not easy.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"The Sworn Blades are being regarded as the putative perpetrators of the bombing from the other day.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"Naturally, the glares being directed at known warriors are going to be particularly harsh.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"And we're walking alongside Inou Hotori, of all people.",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"The most recognized warrior in all the land.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Neither of you are even guilty.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's not like they really hate the warriors, deep down.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“They're just looking for somewhere to vent their frustrations.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"Hotori replies, continuing to face forward with her head held high.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"She never fails to display the comportment of a proud and resolute warrior whenever she presents herself to the public.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Even when they curse her as a war criminal or cast stones at her, she undauntedly faces forward.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"─After all, it was the warriors' fault that we lost the war.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"─After all, it's true that we failed to protect these people.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"No matter how harshly she is treated, Hotori only ever whispers the same things to herself.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Those looks of theirs are what gives me strength.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“'Take care of Okonogi already...'”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If you think of it like that, it only gives you more motivation.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I ought to take a page out of your book.”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"Akari murmurs in affirmation as she stands up a little straighter, her already-regal bearing becoming all the more beautiful.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I really like that about you, you know.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"Hotori shows her a genuine smile.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“People sure are weak.”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Before you know it, they turn to resentment so they can protect their own pride.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The only thing easier than hating others is to hate yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“A real philosopher, aren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"Akari fixes me with a catlike smile.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did it change your life?”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Juuust a smidge.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's a pity.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"As I return a wry smile, the sound of an airplane appears overhead.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"It's a government propaganda aircraft.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"Ever since the war ended, the messages that it delivers have never been good news.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"Hotori and I exchange a grim look and strain our ears to listen.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Female Voice"},
			{
"“Attention. This is an emergency broadcast from the Imperial government.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Female Voice"},
			{
"“Effective beginning April 1st, the possession of all bladed weapons will be prohibited under Imperial law.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Female Voice"},
			{
"“The carrying of such weapons on one's person, and all forms of private ownership of such weapons will be subject to severe penalties.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Female Voice"},
			{
"“Those currently in possession of bladed weapons, please turn them in immediately to the nearest designated facility.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Female Voice"},
			{
"“We appreciate your cooperation. Your safety is important to us.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Female Voice"},
			{
"“This message will now be repeated.”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Female Voice"},
			{
"“Attention. This is an emergency broadcast from the Imperial government.”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"The crackling female voice continues dispassionately repeating the broadcast.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			{
"Hotori's knuckles tighten around the blade at her hip.",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“They're what now?”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What a drastic move...”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"To all warriors, blades represent much more than mere weapons. They are a boon granted to us by Oomikami to carry out His will.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			{
"Even when spellblades were outlawed after the war, we were at the very least still allowed to carry conventional blades.",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"At the time, they surely knew that our discontent would boil over if they had outlawed all blades on top of abolishing the status of our profession.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“They're not just outlawing wearing blades in public,\nthey're even trying to confiscate all of them.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"Hotori directs a hateful glare in the direction of the Imperial Temple.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's downright authoritarian.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, aren't you upset by all this?”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course I am.”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But it's not like we can do anything about it for now. We have to stay calm and think of a strategy moving forward.”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's not what I mean! It's a matter of principle!”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Okonogi... How dare you...!”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
"Hotori's knuckles turn white with anger.",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"The Myougikan views blades as being particularly sacred.",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"It's only natural that Hotori would be outraged.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"It's just that, though I'm also of the Myougikan, I honestly\ndon't have much concern for blades in and of themselves.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"To me, it hardly matters ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"that which I",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"wield.",
{"/font"},
" All that matters is ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"who it is",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"that wields me.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"As long as I am able to serve a worthy lord, I would carry out their will with any weapon at my disposal.",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“They're obviously trying to provoke us.”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I mean, anyone planning on rebelling wouldn't obey the law anyway, right?”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They want to rile us up and crush us when we pop our heads out.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			{
"In which case, I'm worried about the hotheads of the Koubukan under Maki.",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I need to cool my head as well.”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, I'm going on ahead!”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"Hotori runs off before I can get a word in edgewise.",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“To headquarters?”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, I'm going after her. Let's meet back up at school.”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Make sure you give Inou the support she needs.”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I know.”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			{
"I say goodbye to Akari and chase after Hotori's receding figure, already too far away to see.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
